entries[271454] = { ["name"] = "Raging Pauldrons of the Jade Warlord", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nShoulder Plate\n145 Armor\n+48 [Strength or Intellect]\n+754 Stamina\n+ 25 Critical Strike\n+ 56 Mastery\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Warrior\nJade Warlord's Dominion (0/5)\nCuirass of the Jade Warlord\nJeweled Gauntlets of the Jade Warlord\nTempered Horns of the Jade Warlord\nGreaves of the Jade Warlord\nRaging Pauldrons of the Jade Warlord\n(2) Set Arms: Mortal Strike and Execute damage increased by 10% and when you Slam a target, Slam also deals (100% of Attack Power) damage to enemies within 8 yds of it. Deals reduced damage beyond 5 targets.\n(2) Set Fury: Raging Blow damage increased by 15%. During Recklessness Raging Blow extends the duration of Recklessness by 2 sec, up to 6 sec.\n(2) Set Protection: Your free Revenges deal 15% additional damage and cause your next Shield Slam to deal 20% additional damage.\n(4) Set Arms: Overpower damage increased by 15%. Mortal Strike and Overpower increase the damage of your next Slam by 20%, stacking up to 5 times. (500ms cooldown)\n(4) Set Fury: Bloodthirst damage increased by 10%. During Recklessness Bloodthirst increases the critical strike bonus of Recklessness by 3%, up to 6%.\n(4) Set Protection: Ravager and your free Revenges cause all targets to bleed for (304.745% of Attack Power) damage over 12 sec. Ravager's cooldown is reduced by 30 sec.\nSell Price:" }
