entries[271463] = { ["name"] = "Pauldrons of the Consecrated Flame", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nShoulder Plate\n145 Armor\n+48 [Strength or Intellect]\n+754 Stamina\n+ 56 Critical Strike\n+ 24 Mastery\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Paladin\nRadiance of the Consecrated Flame (0/5)\nBulwark of the Consecrated Flame\nGauntlets of the Consecrated Flame\nWarhelm of the Consecrated Flame\nGreaves of the Consecrated Flame\nPauldrons of the Consecrated Flame\n(2) Set Holy: Infusion of Light increases the healing of Flash of Light by an additional 100% and the absorb from Greater Judgment by an additional 100%.\n(2) Set Protection: Consecration is 30% larger and enemies within your Consecration are illuminated, increasing the chance for your abilities to critically strike them by 5%.\n(2) Set Retribution: Divine Purpose has an additional 10% chance to activate, and consuming it grants Divine Power, increasing Holy damage done by 10% for 12 sec.\n(4) Set Holy: Judgment now has a 20% chance to grant Infusion of Light. Holy Light now has a 100% chance to grant Infusion of Light, but its mana cost is increased by 50%.\n(4) Set Protection: Enemies struck by Judgment or [ Blessed Hammer ] [ Hammer of the Righteous / Crusader Strike ] take 20% additional Holy damage. If they are struck by a critical strike the additional damage is increased by 100%.\n(4) Set Retribution: Consuming Divine Purpose grants Divine Arbiter, empowering your other Holy Power spenders to unleash an arbiter of light at their primary target, dealing (1012.5% of Attack Power) Holy damage and (472.5% of Attack Power) Holy damage to enemies within 8 yds. Cannot occur while Divine Arbiter is active.\nSell Price:" }
