entries[271472] = { ["name"] = "Baleful Grave-Knight's Gibbets", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nShoulder Plate\n145 Armor\n+48 [Strength or Intellect]\n+754 Stamina\n+ 26 Haste\n+ 54 Versatility\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Death Knight\nBaleful Grave-Knight's Crucible (0/5)\nBaleful Grave-Knight's Breastplate\nBaleful Grave-Knight's Deathgrips\nBaleful Grave-Knight's Casque\nBaleful Grave-Knight's Greaves\nBaleful Grave-Knight's Gibbets\n(2) Set Blood: When you Death Strike, gain a stack of Blood Debt, increasing Strength by 0.5%, up to 5.0%. When Blood Debt reaches 10 stacks, your next Marrowrend consumes it granting 10% Strength for 10 sec. (250ms cooldown)\n(2) Set Frost: Each time Remorseless Winter damages at least 1 enemy, gain Freezing Tempest which grants 1% attack speed and 2% increased Icy Death Torrent damage for 5 sec, stacking. (100ms cooldown)\n(2) Set Unholy: Your Magus of the Dead and Lord of the Dead cast a more powerful Necrotic Bolt instead of Frostbolt, and Withering Grasp instead of Shadow Bolt.\n(4) Set Blood: When consuming Blood Debt, your next Marrowrend generates 3 additional Boneshield and deals (900% of Attack Power) Shadow damage to your target and (600% of Attack Power) to nearby enemies.\n(4) Set Frost: Remorseless Winter deals damage 25% more frequently, and Freezing Tempest lasts 5 sec longer.\n(4) Set Unholy: Necrotic Bolt's damage is increased by 130%, and Withering Grasp's damage is increased by 130%, against enemies below 35% health.\nSell Price:" }
