entries[271481] = { ["name"] = "Hissing Mantle of the Ophidian Oracle", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nShoulder Mail\n96 Armor\n+48 [Agility or Intellect]\n+754 Stamina\n+ 28 Critical Strike\n+ 53 Mastery\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Shaman\nOphidian Oracle's Prophecy (0/5)\nFanged Raiment of the Ophidian Oracle\nHexing Grips of the Ophidian Oracle\nSerpent Crown of the Ophidian Oracle\nLeggings of the Ophidian Oracle\nHissing Mantle of the Ophidian Oracle\n(2) Set Elemental: Earth Shock, Earthquake, and Elemental Blast damage increased by 25%.\n(2) Set Enhancement: Voltaic Blaze causes your primary target to erupt in a Fire Nova every 2 sec for 6 sec. Fire Nova deals 200% increased damage to the primary target of your Voltaic Blaze.\n(2) Set Restoration: Healing Wave and Chain Heal have a chance to create a Healing Rain at the target's location for 8.0 sec.\n(4) Set Elemental: When Stormkeeper or Ascendance fade, your next 2 Lightning Bolts , Chain Lightnings , or Lava Bursts deal 25% increased damage and cause your next Earthquake, Earth Shock, or Elemental Blast to cost 100% less Maelstrom.\n(4) Set Enhancement: Fire Nova reduces the cooldown of Crash Lightning by 2.0 sec and increases the damage of your next Crash Lightning by 8%, stacking up to 5 times.\n(4) Set Restoration: Every 1 sec, 1 ally inside of Healing Rain gains a watery shield that absorbs 0 damage for 10 sec.\nSell Price:" }
