entries[271490] = { ["name"] = "Jaws of the Skulking Viper", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nShoulder Mail\n96 Armor\n+48 [Agility or Intellect]\n+754 Stamina\n+ 28 Critical Strike\n+ 52 Haste\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Hunter\nSkulking Viper's Ambush (0/5)\nSkulking Viper's Scuteplate\nSkulking Viper's Hidepiercers\nSkulking Viper's Weeping Fangs\nSkulking Viper's Coiled Legwraps\nJaws of the Skulking Viper\n(2) Set Beast Mastery: Barbed Shot causes your pets to stomp one additional time at 50% effectiveness.\n(2) Set Marksmanship: Explosive Shot lasts 1.0 sec longer and deals 5% increased damage.\n(2) Set Survival: Mongoose Fury also increases the damage of Wildfire Bomb by 10%\n(4) Set Beast Mastery: Stomp causes your next Cobra Shot to either benefit from Beast Cleave at 30% effectiveness, or strike your primary target for 20% additional damage, stacking up to 4 times.\n(4) Set Marksmanship: Aimed Shot and Rapid Fire damage increased by 5%. Each time Explosive Shot causes a burst of damage, the cooldown of Aimed Shot and Rapid Fire is reduced by 0.5 sec.\n(4) Set Survival: Each blast of Boomstick extends the duration of Mongoose Fury by 1.0 sec. Mongoose Fury effects are increased by 10%.\nSell Price:" }
