entries[271517] = { ["name"] = "Tassels of the Monkey King", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nShoulder Leather\n65 Armor\n+48 [Agility or Intellect]\n+754 Stamina\n+ 55 Haste\n+ 25 Mastery\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Monk\nGuile of the Monkey King (0/5)\nBattle Gi of the Monkey King\nMonkey King's Fighting Fists\nMonkey King's Unyielding Visage\nPantaloons of the Monkey King\nTassels of the Monkey King\n(2) Set Brewmaster: Breath of Fire ignites your next Keg Smash, causing it to explode on contact, dealing (50% of Attack Power) additional Flamestrike damage to its primary target and reduced damage to additional targets.\n(2) Set Windwalker: Fists of Fury strikes an additional time at the start of its channel at 50% effectiveness.\n(2) Set Mistweaver: Rising Sun Kick deals 30% increased damage and Rushing Wind Kick's healing is increased by 100%.\n(4) Set Brewmaster: Ignited Keg Smashes cause enemies struck to take 8% increased damage from your Physical abilities, and leave a patch of flames on the ground, dealing (25% of Attack Power) Fire damage each second for 5 sec.\n(4) Set Windwalker: Fists of Fury increases the damage of your next Rising Sun Kick by 10% or Spinning Crane Kick by 20% each time it strikes, stacking up to 6 times. (100ms cooldown)\n(4) Set Mistweaver: Rising Sun Kick and Rushing Wind Kick have a chance to cause their next cast to ignore their cooldown and reduce their mana cost by 100%. (250ms cooldown)\nSell Price:" }
