entries[271526] = { ["name"] = "Enigmatic Dreamwatcher's Plumage", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nShoulder Leather\n65 Armor\n+48 [Agility or Intellect]\n+754 Stamina\n+ 55 Critical Strike\n+ 25 Mastery\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Druid\nBark of the Enigmatic Dreamwatcher (0/5)\nEnigmatic Dreamwatcher's Lunar Raiment\nEnigmatic Dreamwatcher's Gauntlets\nEnigmatic Dreamwatcher's Somnolent Stare\nEnigmatic Dreamwatcher's Leggings\nEnigmatic Dreamwatcher's Plumage\n(2) Set Balance: Starsurge damage increased by 20%. Starfall also deals (30.4% of Spell Power) Astral damage instantly to all valid enemies in range when cast.\n(2) Set Feral: When [ Incarnation: Avatar of Ashamane / Berserk] ends, you deal 10% increased damage for [ Incarnation: Avatar of Ashamane : 0.75 ] sec for each combo point spent during [ Incarnation: Avatar of Ashamane / Berserk]. (100ms cooldown)\n(2) Set Guardian: Thrash has a 20% chance to make your next Mangle deal 100% increased damage.\n(2) Set Restoration: Rejuvenation has a 15% chance to grant Genesis, causing all your heal over time effects to heal for 15% more for 8 sec. Multiple applications may overlap. (Proc chance: 15%, 100ms cooldown)\n(4) Set Balance: Your damage is increased by 10% while in any Eclipse. This bonus wanes to 2% at the midpoint of the Eclipse, then waxes back to 10% at the end. (100ms cooldown)\n(4) Set Feral: [ Incarnation: Avatar of Ashamane / Berserk] lasts 10 sec longer.\n(4) Set Guardian: Thrash calls up 3 thorns, each impaling a target for (54% of Attack Power) Nature damage and dealing (27% of Attack Power) additional Nature damage to up to 5 nearby enemies, and extends the duration of [ Incarnation: Guardian of Ursoc / Berserk] by 0.5 sec, up to 5.0 sec.\n(4) Set Restoration: Nature's Swiftness, Tranquility, and [ Incarnation: Tree of Life / Convoke the Spirits] have a 100% chance to grant Genesis, and Genesis duration is increased by 8 sec.\nSell Price:" }
