entries[271535] = { ["name"] = "Abyssal Doomhound's Jaws", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nShoulder Leather\n65 Armor\n+48 [Agility or Intellect]\n+754 Stamina\n+ 28 Critical Strike\n+ 52 Versatility\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Demon Hunter\nAbyssal Doomhound's Pursuit (0/5)\nAbyssal Doomhound's Coreguard\nAbyssal Doomhound's Studded Gauntlets\nAbyssal Doomhound's Relentless Stare\nAbyssal Doomhound's Legwraps\nAbyssal Doomhound's Jaws\n(2) Set Havoc: Blade Dance, Chaos Strike, and Essence Break have 12% increased damage.\n(2) Set Vengeance: Sigil of Flame's damage over time is increased by 50%. Soul Cleave increases the duration of Sigil of Flame on your primary target by 2.0 sec.\n(2) Set Devourer: Harvesting 4 or more Soul Fragments with Reap has a 20% chance to cause your next Consume to be instant cast and explode in a Soulburst, dealing (600% of Spell Power) Cosmic damage to nearby enemies.\n(4) Set Havoc: Essence Break now applies and benefits from the effects of Cycle of Hatred, has 35% increased initial strike damage, and has 2.0 sec increased duration.\n(4) Set Vengeance: Immolation Aura and Sigil of Spite have 100% increased damage against targets affected by your Sigil of Flame.\n(4) Set Devourer: Soulburst generates 2 Soul Fragments and grants Moment of Craving. Reap deals 10% increased damage.\nSell Price:" }
